<title>USA: Global Ocean Carriers Ltd Q2, Q4 results.</title>
<headline>Global Ocean Carriers Ltd Q2, Q4 results.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.06		    $0.69</p>
<p> Net			259,670		2,838,618</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER 31</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.17		    $1.00</p>
<p> Net			705,533		4,105,708</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for the first tabulated section pertain to the six-month period ended December 31 1996 and 1995 respectively as the company records results on a semi-annual basis.</p>
<p>The company said 1996 results include the adoption of an extended depreciation policy on the company's container vessels that better reflects the vessels' expected useful lives and that lowered 1996 expenses.</p>
</text>
